{"schema_version":"appworld-codex-plan-v1","status":"needs_more_public_schema","failure_reason":"The available Spotify read APIs expose queue and playback state but no liked-state field, so the required post-mutation verification cannot confirm that every selected song is liked.","missing_public_schema_fields":["spotify.show_song_queue response items need an is_liked boolean (or an equivalent public read API listing liked song IDs)"],"task_id":"ccb4494_1","task_family":"ccb4494","completion_mode":"status_only","plan_summary":"A compliant executable plan cannot be completed until liked status can be re-read after calling spotify.like_song.","steps":[]}